	"nodes":[
		{"id":"95670235def11240","x":-372,"y":-264,"width":1372,"height":2144,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\ngraph TB\n    Start([Start Metadata Generation]) --> GetBatch[Get Table Batch]\n    \n    GetBatch --> ParallelTables{Process Tables<br/>in Parallel}\n    \n    ParallelTables -->|Table 1| T1[Process Table 1]\n    ParallelTables -->|Table 2| T2[Process Table 2]\n    ParallelTables -->|Table 3| T3[Process Table 3]\n    ParallelTables -->|Table 4| T4[Process Table 4]\n    ParallelTables -->|Table 5| T5[Process Table 5]\n    \n    T1 --> T1_Clean[Clean Label]\n    T1_Clean --> T1_Initial[Initial Table LLM Call]\n    T1_Initial --> T1_Update1[Update Table Doc]\n    T1_Update1 --> T1_Cols[Column Processing]\n    \n    T1_Cols --> T1_CB1[Column Batch 1]\n    T1_CB1 -->|Sequential| T1_CB2[Column Batch 2]\n    T1_CB2 -->|Sequential| T1_CB3[Column Batch 3]\n    T1_CB3 -->|Sequential| T1_CBN[Column Batch N]\n    \n    T1_CBN --> T1_Refine[Re-infer Table<br/>with Full Context]\n    T1_Refine --> T1_Done[Table 1 Done]\n    \n    T2 --> T2_Process[Similar Sequential<br/>Column Processing]\n    T2_Process --> T2_Done[Table 2 Done]\n    \n    T3 --> T3_Process[Similar Sequential<br/>Column Processing]\n    T3_Process --> T3_Done[Table 3 Done]\n    \n    T4 --> T4_Process[Similar Sequential<br/>Column Processing]\n    T4_Process --> T4_Done[Table 4 Done]\n    \n    T5 --> T5_Process[Similar Sequential<br/>Column Processing]\n    T5_Process --> T5_Done[Table 5 Done]\n    \n    T1_Done --> Gather[asyncio.gather<br/>Wait for All Tables]\n    T2_Done --> Gather\n    T3_Done --> Gather\n    T4_Done --> Gather\n    T5_Done --> Gather\n    \n    Gather --> NextBatch{More Tables?}\n    NextBatch -->|Yes| GetBatch\n    NextBatch -->|No| End([End])\n    \n    style ParallelTables fill:#90EE90\n    style Gather fill:#90EE90\n    style T1_CB1 fill:#FFB6C1\n    style T1_CB2 fill:#FFB6C1\n    style T1_CB3 fill:#FFB6C1\n    style T1_CBN fill:#FFB6C1\n    \n    classDef parallel fill:#90EE90,stroke:#333,stroke-width:3px\n    classDef sequential fill:#FFB6C1,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n```\n"},
		{"id":"524003225259e688","x":1840,"y":-120,"width":1200,"height":2360,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\ngraph TB\n    Start([Table Batch Starts]) --> Parallel{asyncio.gather<br/>Parallel Execution}\n    \n    Parallel -->|Table 1| T1_Start[Table 1 Processing]\n    Parallel -->|Table 2| T2_Start[Table 2 Processing]\n    Parallel -->|Table 3| T3_Start[Table 3 Processing]\n    \n    subgraph Table1[\"Table 1 Timeline\"]\n        T1_Start --> T1_Clean[Clean Label]\n        T1_Clean --> T1_Initial[Initial Table LLM]\n        T1_Initial --> T1_Update1[Update Table Doc]\n        T1_Update1 --> T1_ColBatch1[Column Batch 1]\n        T1_ColBatch1 --> T1_ColBatch2[Column Batch 2]\n        T1_ColBatch2 --> T1_ColBatchN[Column Batch N]\n        T1_ColBatchN --> T1_Fetch[Fetch All Columns]\n        T1_Fetch --> T1_Reinfer[Re-infer Table<br/>with Full Context]\n        T1_Reinfer --> T1_UpdateFinal[Update Table Doc<br/>with Refined Metadata]\n        T1_UpdateFinal --> T1_Done[✓ Table 1 Complete]\n    end\n    \n    subgraph Table2[\"Table 2 Timeline\"]\n        T2_Start --> T2_Clean[Clean Label]\n        T2_Clean --> T2_Initial[Initial Table LLM]\n        T2_Initial --> T2_Update1[Update Table Doc]\n        T2_Update1 --> T2_ColBatch1[Column Batch 1]\n        T2_ColBatch1 --> T2_Fetch[Fetch All Columns]\n        T2_Fetch --> T2_Reinfer[Re-infer Table<br/>with Full Context]\n        T2_Reinfer --> T2_UpdateFinal[Update Table Doc<br/>with Refined Metadata]\n        T2_UpdateFinal --> T2_Done[✓ Table 2 Complete]\n    end\n    \n    subgraph Table3[\"Table 3 Timeline\"]\n        T3_Start --> T3_Clean[Clean Label]\n        T3_Clean --> T3_Initial[Initial Table LLM]\n        T3_Initial --> T3_Update1[Update Table Doc]\n        T3_Update1 --> T3_ColBatch1[Column Batch 1]\n        T3_ColBatch1 --> T3_ColBatch2[Column Batch 2]\n        T3_ColBatch2 --> T3_Fetch[Fetch All Columns]\n        T3_Fetch --> T3_Reinfer[Re-infer Table<br/>with Full Context]\n        T3_Reinfer --> T3_UpdateFinal[Update Table Doc<br/>with Refined Metadata]\n        T3_UpdateFinal --> T3_Done[✓ Table 3 Complete]\n    end\n    \n    T1_Done --> Wait[asyncio.gather Waits]\n    T2_Done --> Wait\n    T3_Done --> Wait\n    \n    Wait --> AllDone[All Tables in Batch Complete]\n    AllDone --> NextBatch{More Table Batches?}\n    NextBatch -->|Yes| Start\n    NextBatch -->|No| End([End])\n    \n    style T1_Reinfer fill:#FFD700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:3px\n    style T2_Reinfer fill:#FFD700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:3px\n    style T3_Reinfer fill:#FFD700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:3px\n    style T1_UpdateFinal fill:#FFD700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style T2_UpdateFinal fill:#FFD700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style T3_UpdateFinal fill:#FFD700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style Parallel fill:#90EE90,stroke:#333,stroke-width:3px\n    style Wait fill:#FF6B6B,stroke:#333,stroke-width:3px\n    \n    classDef reinfer fill:#FFD700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:3px\n```\n"}
